                    The Biggest Mistake Men Make When Removing Back Hair
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Most men try regular razors, clippers, or even asking for
                    help. These tools were never designed for the back. Your
                    back has curves, blind spots, and sensitive areas like the
                    T4 vertebrae zone.
                </p>
                <p
                    class="bg-red-50 text-red-700 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-100 font-bold italic mb-8"
                >
                    "Using the wrong tool leads to nicks, missed patches, and
                    soul-crushing frustration."
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">
