                    >
                    </div>
                    <h2
                        class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-0 mb-6"
                    >
                        Stop Ignoring It. Fix It in 5 Minutes.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-10 text-lg">
                        We've tested 20+ specialized back shavers to find the
